(https://github.com/SaladDay/cc-switch-cli) and CC Switch
(https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch). Neither is a runtime dependency.
This distribution does not include the cc-switch source tree or claim affiliation.
No cc-switch implementation code is knowingly included in these two Python tools.
If future contributions copy upstream implementation code, retain its original
copyright and MIT license attribution alongside the copied material.

The two root scripts were supplied from the author's local implementation for
this authorized release; local credentials, history, experimental trials and
real-world repair reports are not part of this distribution.
